(2000000000000000001,'斐波那契数列','### 题目描述\n求斐波那契数列第 n 项。已知 F(1)=1，F(2)=1，F(n)=F(n-1)+F(n-2)。\n\n### 输入格式\n一个整数 n（1 <= n <= 40）。\n\n### 输出格式\n输出 F(n)。\n\n### 样例输入\n10\n\n### 样例输出\n55\n\n### 提示\n可以用递归、递推或滚动变量实现，注意避免重复计算。','["数据结构","简单","递归"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int n = sc.nextInt();\n    long a = 1, b = 1;\n    for (int i = 3; i <= n; i++) {\n      long c = a + b; a = b; b = c;\n    }\n    System.out.println(n <= 2 ? 1 : b);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"1","output":"1"},{"input":"5","output":"5"},{"input":"10","output":"55"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000002,'数组求和','### 题目描述\n给定 n 个整数，求它们的和。\n\n### 输入格式\n第一行一个整数 n（1 <= n <= 1000）。\n第二行 n 个整数，用空格分隔。\n\n### 输出格式\n输出这 n 个整数的和。\n\n### 样例输入\n5\n1 2 3 4 5\n\n### 样例输出\n15','["数据结构","简单","数组"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int n = sc.nextInt();\n    long sum = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) sum += sc.nextInt();\n    System.out.println(sum);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"5\\n1 2 3 4 5","output":"15"},{"input":"3\\n-1 0 1","output":"0"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000003,'字符串反转','### 题目描述\n输入一个字符串，将其反转后输出。\n\n### 输入格式\n一行字符串（长度不超过 1000，不含空格）。\n\n### 输出格式\n反转后的字符串。\n\n### 样例输入\nhello\n\n### 样例输出\nolleh','["字符串","简单","双指针"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    String s = sc.nextLine();\n    System.out.println(new StringBuilder(s).reverse().toString());\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"hello","output":"olleh"},{"input":"408","output":"804"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000004,'回文串判断','### 题目描述\n判断一个字符串是否为回文串。回文串指正着读和倒着读都一样的字符串。\n\n### 输入格式\n一行字符串（仅包含字母和数字，长度不超过 1000）。\n\n### 输出格式\n是回文串输出 YES，否则输出 NO。\n\n### 样例输入\nlevel\n\n### 样例输出\nYES','["字符串","简单","双指针"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    String s = sc.nextLine();\n    int i = 0, j = s.length() - 1;\n    boolean ok = true;\n    while (i < j) { if (s.charAt(i++) != s.charAt(j--)) { ok = false; break; } }\n    System.out.println(ok ? "YES" : "NO");\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"level","output":"YES"},{"input":"abc","output":"NO"},{"input":"12321","output":"YES"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000005,'二分查找','### 题目描述\n给定一个升序排列的整数数组和目标值 target，请用二分查找返回 target 第一次出现的下标（从 0 开始）。若不存在输出 -1。\n\n### 输入格式\n第一行整数 n（1 <= n <= 100000）。\n第二行 n 个升序整数。\n第三行目标值 target。\n\n### 输出格式\n目标值的下标或 -1。\n\n### 样例输入\n5\n1 3 5 7 9\n5\n\n### 样例输出\n2','["数据结构","中等","查找"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int n = sc.nextInt();\n    int[] a = new int[n];\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) a[i] = sc.nextInt();\n    int t = sc.nextInt();\n    int l = 0, r = n - 1, ans = -1;\n    while (l <= r) {\n      int mid = (l + r) >>> 1;\n      if (a[mid] >= t) { if (a[mid] == t) ans = mid; r = mid - 1; }\n      else l = mid + 1;\n    }\n    System.out.println(ans);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"5\\n1 3 5 7 9\\n5","output":"2"},{"input":"5\\n1 3 5 7 9\\n7","output":"3"},{"input":"5\\n1 3 5 7 9\\n4","output":"-1"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000006,'冒泡排序','### 题目描述\n使用冒泡排序将 n 个整数从小到大排序并输出。\n\n### 输入格式\n第一行整数 n（1 <= n <= 1000）。\n第二行 n 个整数。\n\n### 输出格式\n排序后的 n 个整数，用空格分隔。\n\n### 样例输入\n5\n5 1 4 2 8\n\n### 样例输出\n1 2 4 5 8','["数据结构","中等","排序"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int n = sc.nextInt();\n    int[] a = new int[n];\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) a[i] = sc.nextInt();\n    for (int i = 0; i < n - 1; i++)\n      for (int j = 0; j < n - 1 - i; j++)\n        if (a[j] > a[j + 1]) { int t = a[j]; a[j] = a[j + 1]; a[j + 1] = t; }\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) System.out.print(a[i] + (i == n - 1 ? "" : " "));\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"5\\n5 1 4 2 8","output":"1 2 4 5 8"},{"input":"3\\n3 2 1","output":"1 2 3"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000007,'括号匹配','### 题目描述\n给定一个只包含 ()[]{} 的字符串，判断括号是否合法匹配。\n\n### 输入格式\n一行字符串（长度不超过 10000）。\n\n### 输出格式\n合法输出 YES，否则输出 NO。\n\n### 样例输入\n([{}])\n\n### 样例输出\nYES','["数据结构","中等","栈"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    String s = sc.nextLine();\n    Deque<Character> st = new ArrayDeque<>();\n    boolean ok = true;\n    for (char c : s.toCharArray()) {\n      if (c == 40 || c == 91 || c == 123) st.push(c);\n      else {\n        if (st.isEmpty()) { ok = false; break; }\n        char t = st.pop();\n        if ((c == 41 && t != 40) || (c == 93 && t != 91) || (c == 125 && t != 123)) { ok = false; break; }\n      }\n    }\n    System.out.println(ok && st.isEmpty() ? "YES" : "NO");\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"([{}])","output":"YES"},{"input":"(]","output":"NO"},{"input":"()[]{}","output":"YES"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000008,'最大子数组和','### 题目描述\n给定一个整数数组，找到一个具有最大和的连续子数组，输出其最大和。\n\n### 输入格式\n第一行整数 n（1 <= n <= 100000）。\n第二行 n 个整数（-10000 <= ai <= 10000）。\n\n### 输出格式\n最大连续子数组和。\n\n### 样例输入\n8\n-2 1 -3 4 -1 2 1 -5\n\n### 样例输出\n6','["算法","中等","动态规划"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int n = sc.nextInt();\n    long best = Long.MIN_VALUE, cur = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n      long x = sc.nextLong();\n      cur = cur > 0 ? cur + x : x;\n      best = Math.max(best, cur);\n    }\n    System.out.println(best);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"8\\n-2 1 -3 4 -1 2 1 -5","output":"6"},{"input":"3\\n-1 -2 -3","output":"-1"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000009,'进制转换','### 题目描述\n将十进制整数转换为指定进制（2、8 或 16），16 进制使用大写字母。\n\n### 输入格式\n两个整数 n 和 base（0 <= n <= 10^9，base 为 2、8 或 16）。\n\n### 输出格式\n转换后的字符串。\n\n### 样例输入\n255 16\n\n### 样例输出\nFF','["计算机组成原理","简单","进制"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    long n = sc.nextLong();\n    int base = sc.nextInt();\n    System.out.println(Long.toString(n, base).toUpperCase());\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"255 16","output":"FF"},{"input":"10 2","output":"1010"},{"input":"8 8","output":"10"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000010,'FIFO 页面置换','### 题目描述\n模拟操作系统的先进先出（FIFO）页面置换算法，统计缺页次数。\n\n### 输入格式\n第一行物理块数 m（1 <= m <= 10）。\n第二行访问序列长度 n（1 <= n <= 1000）。\n第三行 n 个页面号。\n\n### 输出格式\n缺页次数。\n\n### 样例输入\n3\n12\n1 2 3 4 1 2 5 1 2 3 4 5\n\n### 样例输出\n10','["操作系统","中等","页面置换"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int m = sc.nextInt(), n = sc.nextInt();\n    int[] frames = new int[m];\n    Arrays.fill(frames, -1);\n    int ptr = 0, faults = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n      int p = sc.nextInt();\n      boolean hit = false;\n      for (int f : frames) if (f == p) { hit = true; break; }\n      if (!hit) {\n        frames[ptr] = p;\n        ptr = (ptr + 1) % m;\n        faults++;\n      }\n    }\n    System.out.println(faults);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"3\\n12\\n1 2 3 4 1 2 5 1 2 3 4 5","output":"10"},{"input":"1\\n3\\n1 2 1","output":"2"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000011,'IP 地址合法性','### 题目描述\n判断一个 IPv4 地址是否合法：由 4 个 0-255 的十进制整数组成，用点分隔，不允许前导零（0 本身除外）。\n\n### 输入格式\n一行字符串。\n\n### 输出格式\n合法输出 YES，否则输出 NO。\n\n### 样例输入\n192.168.1.1\n\n### 样例输出\nYES','["计算机网络","简单","字符串"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    String s = sc.nextLine().trim();\n    String[] parts = s.split("\\\\.", -1);\n    boolean ok = parts.length == 4;\n    if (ok) for (String p : parts) {\n      if (p.isEmpty() || p.length() > 3) { ok = false; break; }\n      if (p.length() > 1 && p.charAt(0) == 48) { ok = false; break; }\n      for (char c : p.toCharArray()) if (c < 48 || c > 57) { ok = false; break; }\n      if (!ok) break;\n      if (Integer.parseInt(p) > 255) { ok = false; break; }\n    }\n    System.out.println(ok ? "YES" : "NO");\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"192.168.1.1","output":"YES"},{"input":"256.1.1.1","output":"NO"},{"input":"192.168.1","output":"NO"},{"input":"0.0.0.0","output":"YES"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000012,'快速排序','### 题目描述\n实现快速排序，将 n 个整数升序输出。\n\n### 输入格式\n第一行整数 n（1 <= n <= 100000）。\n第二行 n 个整数。\n\n### 输出格式\n升序排列的整数，空格分隔。\n\n### 样例输入\n6\n4 2 6 1 3 5\n\n### 样例输出\n1 2 3 4 5 6','["数据结构","中等","排序"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  static void qs(int[] a, int l, int r) {\n    if (l >= r) return;\n    int i = l, j = r, p = a[(l + r) >>> 1];\n    while (i <= j) {\n      while (a[i] < p) i++;\n      while (a[j] > p) j--;\n      if (i <= j) { int t = a[i]; a[i] = a[j]; a[j] = t; i++; j--; }\n    }\n    qs(a, l, j); qs(a, i, r);\n  }\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int n = sc.nextInt();\n    int[] a = new int[n];\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) a[i] = sc.nextInt();\n    qs(a, 0, n - 1);\n    StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) { if (i > 0) sb.append(" "); sb.append(a[i]); }\n    System.out.println(sb);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"6\\n4 2 6 1 3 5","output":"1 2 3 4 5 6"},{"input":"3\\n3 3 1","output":"1 3 3"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000013,'矩阵转置','### 题目描述\n给定 m 行 n 列的矩阵，输出它的转置（n 行 m 列）。\n\n### 输入格式\n第一行 m n（1 <= m,n <= 100）。\n接下来 m 行，每行 n 个整数。\n\n### 输出格式\n转置后的矩阵，每行 n 个数改为每行 m 个数。\n\n### 样例输入\n2 3\n1 2 3\n4 5 6\n\n### 样例输出\n1 4\n2 5\n3 6','["数据结构","简单","矩阵"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    int m = sc.nextInt(), n = sc.nextInt();\n    int[][] a = new int[m][n];\n    for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) a[i][j] = sc.nextInt();\n    for (int j = 0; j < n; j++) {\n      StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();\n      for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) { if (i > 0) sb.append(" "); sb.append(a[i][j]); }\n      System.out.println(sb);\n    }\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"2 3\\n1 2 3\\n4 5 6","output":"1 4\\n2 5\\n3 6"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000014,'阶乘末尾零','### 题目描述\n给定 n，求 n! 末尾有多少个连续的 0。\n\n### 输入格式\n一个整数 n（1 <= n <= 10^9）。\n\n### 输出格式\n末尾零的个数。\n\n### 样例输入\n25\n\n### 样例输出\n6','["算法","简单","数学"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    long n = sc.nextLong(), ans = 0;\n    while (n > 0) { n /= 5; ans += n; }\n    System.out.println(ans);\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"5","output":"1"},{"input":"10","output":"2"},{"input":"25","output":"6"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0),

(2000000000000000015,'素数判断','### 题目描述\n判断一个正整数是否为素数。\n\n### 输入格式\n一个整数 n（1 <= n <= 10^9）。\n\n### 输出格式\n是素数输出 YES，否则输出 NO。\n\n### 样例输入\n7\n\n### 样例输出\nYES','["算法","简单","数学"]','import java.util.*;\npublic class Main {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n    long n = sc.nextLong();\n    boolean ok = n >= 2;\n    for (long i = 2; i * i <= n; i++) if (n % i == 0) { ok = false; break; }\n    System.out.println(ok ? "YES" : "NO");\n  }\n}',0,0,'[{"input":"7","output":"YES"},{"input":"9","output":"NO"},{"input":"2","output":"YES"}]','{"timeLimit":2,"memoryLimit":262144,"stackLimit":5000}',0,0,1,NOW(),NOW(),0);
